---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Case Studies" description="See how Erdem has helped manufacturers, SACCOs, and insurers transform their data into decisions.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Our Work</p>
      <h1>From raw data to <span style="color:var(--cyan);">real decisions.</span></h1>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;">Three engagements across manufacturing, financial services, and insurance.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;">
      <a href="/case-studies/feed-manufacturer" class="cs-card fade-up">
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">Manufacturing</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-dim);">Client Engagement</span></div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3;">From Paper Registers to Remote-Ready Dashboards</h2>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">A Nairobi feed manufacturer eliminated a week-long reporting process with an automated Python-to-Power BI pipeline. Now managed fully remotely.</p>
          <div class="cs-metrics">
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">7 days → 1 hr</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Reporting time</span></div>
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">2 weeks</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Delivery</span></div>
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">Retainer</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Model</span></div>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);margin-top:12px;display:inline-block;">Read Case Study →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-img"><img src="/images/dashboards/all-dashboards.jpg" alt="Manufacturing dashboard" style="object-position:top;" /></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/case-studies/sacco" class="cs-card fade-up">
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">SACCO</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-dim);">Illustrative Example</span></div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3;">From Ledger Books to Loan Intelligence</h2>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">A Kenyan SACCO automated SASRA compliance, built a default prediction model, and reduced loan defaults by 31% in six months.</p>
          <div class="cs-metrics">
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">31%</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Default reduction</span></div>
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">3 wks → 1 day</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">SASRA report</span></div>
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">Retainer</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Model</span></div>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);margin-top:12px;display:inline-block;">Read Case Study →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-img"><img src="/images/dashboards/all-dashboards.jpg" alt="SACCO dashboard" style="object-position:center;" /></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/case-studies/insurance" class="cs-card fade-up">
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">Insurance</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-dim);">Illustrative Example</span></div>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3;">Turning Claims Chaos into Compliance Clarity</h2>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">A Kenyan insurer automated claims reporting, flagged 18% of backlog as fraudulent, and gained real-time branch visibility.</p>
          <div class="cs-metrics">
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">18%</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Fraud flagged</span></div>
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">5 days → 2 hrs</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Report time</span></div>
            <div><span class="cs-metric-val">Retainer</span><span class="cs-metric-lbl">Model</span></div>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);margin-top:12px;display:inline-block;">Read Case Study →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-img"><img src="/images/dashboards/all-dashboards.jpg" alt="Insurance dashboard" style="object-position:bottom;" /></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-mid" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:14px;">Your organization could be next.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);max-width:420px;margin:0 auto 32px;">Tell us what you're working with and we'll show you what Erdem would build for you.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cyan">Start a Conversation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
